ith one last chance to break free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f1\ufe0f Quick sessions \u2014 they don't last long but demand maximum concentration. Perfect for those who appreciate a challenge and limited time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Can you deliver the cargo in one piece?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn the ignition on and prepare for the toughest journey of your life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759140/extras/da92228f9ee8ceac3db0014dfe05511d.poster.avif?t=1767883128\" width=800 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759140/extras/da92228f9ee8ceac3db0014dfe05511d.webm?t=1767883128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759140/extras/da92228f9ee8ceac3db0014dfe05511d.mp4?t=1767883128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759140/extras/3187091c77b645047f307f7c2aeee6ad.poster.avif?t=1767883128\" width=800 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759140/extras/3187091c77b645047f307f7c2aeee6ad.webm?t=1767883128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759140/extras/3187091c77b645047f307f7c2aeee6ad.mp4?t=1767883128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Avoidance"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass